@page "/"
@using ShellIcons.Icons

<PageTitle>ShellIcons — Blazor Sample</PageTitle>

<h1><Zap Size="28" /> ShellIcons</h1>

<p>
    Lucide-derived SVG icons for Blazor. Zero JS, zero CSS. Colors inherit from
    the ancestor's <code>color</code>.
</p>

<h2>Catalog — full Lucide 0.475.0 (@ShellIcon.Names.Count icons, generator-emitted)</h2>

<div class="icon-grid">
    <div class="icon-cell"><ChevronLeft />   <span>chevron-left</span></div>
    <div class="icon-cell"><ChevronRight />  <span>chevron-right</span></div>
    <div class="icon-cell"><ChevronDown />   <span>chevron-down</span></div>
    <div class="icon-cell"><X />             <span>x</span></div>
    <div class="icon-cell"><House />         <span>house</span></div>
    <div class="icon-cell"><Zap />           <span>zap</span></div>
    <div class="icon-cell"><TriangleAlert /> <span>triangle-alert</span></div>
    <div class="icon-cell"><CircleCheck />   <span>circle-check</span></div>
    <div class="icon-cell"><Search />        <span>search</span></div>
    <div class="icon-cell"><Heart />         <span>heart</span></div>
    <div class="icon-cell"><Star />          <span>star</span></div>
    <div class="icon-cell"><Rocket />        <span>rocket</span></div>
    <div class="icon-cell"><Github />        <span>github</span></div>
    <div class="icon-cell"><Settings />      <span>settings</span></div>
    <div class="icon-cell"><Bell />          <span>bell</span></div>
    <div class="icon-cell"><Coffee />        <span>coffee</span></div>
    <div class="icon-cell"><Camera />        <span>camera</span></div>
</div>

<h2>Dispatcher form</h2>

<p>Look up any of the @ShellIcon.Names.Count icons by kebab-case name (trimmer-hostile — ships full catalog):</p>

<div class="row">
    <ShellIcon Name="pizza" Size="32" />
    <ShellIcon Name="cat" Size="32" />
    <ShellIcon Name="ghost" Size="32" />
    <ShellIcon Name="skull" Size="32" />
    <ShellIcon Name="crown" Size="32" />
</div>

<h2>Sizing</h2>

<div class="row">
    <Zap Size="12" />
    <Zap Size="16" />
    <Zap Size="24" />
    <Zap Size="32" />
    <Zap Size="48" />
    <Zap Size="64" />
</div>

<p><code>Size="1.5em"</code> works too, as does <code>Size="100%"</code>:</p>

<div class="row" style="font-size: 24px;">
    <Zap Size="1.5em" />
    <span>inline with 24px text</span>
</div>

<h2>Stroke width</h2>

<div class="row">
    <Zap Size="40" StrokeWidth="0.75" />
    <Zap Size="40" StrokeWidth="1" />
    <Zap Size="40" StrokeWidth="1.5" />
    <Zap Size="40" StrokeWidth="2" />
    <Zap Size="40" StrokeWidth="3" />
</div>

<h2>Color inheritance</h2>

<p>Every icon uses <code>stroke="currentColor"</code>. Set <code>color</code> on any ancestor:</p>

<div class="row">
    <span style="color: crimson;"><TriangleAlert Size="32" /></span>
    <span style="color: seagreen;"><CircleCheck Size="32" /></span>
    <span style="color: royalblue;"><Search Size="32" /></span>
    <span style="color: rebeccapurple;"><Zap Size="32" /></span>
</div>

<h2>Buttons — real usage</h2>

<div class="row">
    <button class="btn"><House Size="16" /> Home</button>
    <button class="btn btn-danger"><TriangleAlert Size="16" /> Delete</button>
    <button class="btn btn-primary">Next <ChevronRight Size="16" /></button>
</div>

<h2>Accessibility</h2>

<p>
    Without <code>Title</code>, icons are decorative (<code>aria-hidden="true"</code>).
    With <code>Title</code>, they get a proper accessible name.
</p>

<div class="row">
    <X Title="Close dialog" Size="24" />
    <span>← inspect this element; screen readers announce "Close dialog"</span>
</div>

<h2>Absolute stroke</h2>

<p>By default, stroke scales with size. <code>AbsoluteStroke</code> keeps it visually constant:</p>

<div class="row">
    <span>Default: <Zap Size="16" /><Zap Size="24" /><Zap Size="48" /></span>
</div>
<div class="row">
    <span>Absolute: <Zap Size="16" AbsoluteStroke /><Zap Size="24" AbsoluteStroke /><Zap Size="48" AbsoluteStroke /></span>
</div>

<style>
    .icon-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(140px, 1fr));
        gap: 12px;
        margin: 16px 0;
    }
    .icon-cell {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 16px 8px;
        border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #6b7280;
    }
    .row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        margin: 12px 0;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        padding: 8px 14px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
        background: #fff;
        cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn-primary { background: #2563eb; color: white; border-color: #2563eb; }
    .btn-danger  { background: #dc2626; color: white; border-color: #dc2626; }
</style>
